Unreleased
---
Deprecated
- WindowStyleAgent: deprecated and to be removed. Nothing in the tree refers to
  it, no page documents it, it is only built when QX_WINDOW_CONFIG_STYLE_AGENT is
  on (off by default), and QxThemeManager in qxtheme already follows the system
  colour scheme - more completely than this class does. HighContrast is the one
  value QxThemeManager does not report; if that becomes a real need, revisit it
  then.

Cleanup
- Settle the eight TODO/FIXME comments inherited from upstream (seven in
  windowcontext_win.cpp, one in windowsystem_p.h). Two of them were dead `#if 0`
  blocks that only listed WM_NCPOINTER* cases and are now removed; the remaining
  four sites became NOTE comments, each pointing at an entry in
  doc/pages/limitations.md. No behaviour change and no API change.

